      en: ["Supports an estimated 50% of the global population of Livingstone's fruit bats.", "The forest is located at elevations ranging from 500 to 1,200 meters above sea level.", "Anjouan has lost over 80% of its primary forest cover in the last 50 years.", "International NGOs like Dahari are actively involved in forest conservation efforts.", "The area is a critical habitat for the endemic Anjouan sparrowhawk.", "Annual rainfall in these high-altitude regions can exceed 3,000 mm."],
      es: ["Superficie: 500 ha", "Altitud: 400-800 m", "Especies endémicas: zorro volador de las Comoras, halcón de las Comoras", "Amenaza: deforestación", "Pérdida de bosque en 10 años: 20%", "Cuenca hidrográfica: sí"],
      pt: ["Área: 500 ha", "Altitude: 400-800 m", "Espécies endémicas: raposa-voadora das Comores, falcão das Comores", "Ameaça: desflorestação", "Perda de floresta em 10 anos: 20%", "Bacia hidrográfica: sim"],
